{"id":"wb-8-485","name":"汉建初元年买地刻石","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"汉建初元年买地刻石","text":"汉建初元年买地刻石，又名建初买山地记、大吉碑，是浙江省绍兴市境内的一处东汉摩崖石刻。石刻位于越城区富盛镇乌石村西南跳山东坡，刻于东汉建初元年（76年），是浙江省内已知年代最早的摩崖题刻，也是中国境内现存最大的买山地券。2019年10月7日，建初元年买地刻石被列入第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B1%89%E5%BB%BA%E5%88%9D%E5%85%83%E5%B9%B4%E4%B9%B0%E5%9C%B0%E5%88%BB%E7%9F%B3","revisionId":94224121,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94224121","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/4ac337eef678ebec632bca4e.jpg","title":"汉建初元年买地刻石,_2021-04-17_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%B1%89%E5%BB%BA%E5%88%9D%E5%85%83%E5%B9%B4%E4%B9%B0%E5%9C%B0%E5%88%BB%E7%9F%B3,_2021-04-17_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/19/%E6%B1%89%E5%BB%BA%E5%88%9D%E5%85%83%E5%B9%B4%E4%B9%B0%E5%9C%B0%E5%88%BB%E7%9F%B3%2C_2021-04-17_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​汉建初元年买地刻石","width":320,"height":214}}